{
  "name": "addressable_register",
  "description": "Addressable register (type 204, dataBus 4), 8 outputs in 2 words (addrBus=1). Inputs [addr0=link0, data0..3=link1..4, clk=link5], outputs link6..13. On each rising clock the 4-bit data bus latches into the addressed word. Writes word0=1010, then word1=1100 (word0 persists), then rewrites word0=0001 (word1 persists).",
